# ALLOWLIST. Everything is ignored; code and documentation are let in by pattern.
# Data -- public, project-owned or licensed -- is never committed by default. A public
# data file is committed only by adding it below AND to PUBLIC_DATA.txt, with its
# citation in CITATIONS.md (README.md: Data).
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.html
!*.md
!Makefile
!.gitignore
!PUBLIC_DATA.txt
!requirements.txt
!flows/regions.json
!LICENSE
!data/stories/march_2026_three_counties_articles.csv
!data/stories/march_2026_three_counties_places.csv
!flows/d3.min.js

# Scratch captures of rendered maps.
flows/probe.html
flows/_probe.html
# datadesk's own CSS and fonts (README.md: Running the map pages).
flows/dd/
# Tooling.
__pycache__/
.venv/
logs/
